<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine tobacco firm Nobleza Q3 net $18.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentine tobacco firm Nobleza Q3 net $18.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to September 30. Net $18.9 million vs n/a</p>
<p>NOTE: the company did not provide comparative figures or EPS.</p>
<p>It said Q3 results are after $9.6 million in corporate tax payments. At September 30 the net worth stood at $157 million and retained earnings at $50.9 million.</p>
<p>- Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650</p>
</text>
